<article class="env-lemma" id="04BA">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/04BA">Lemma <span data-tag="04BA">7.42.6</span>.</a> Let $f : \mathcal{D} \to \mathcal{C}$ be a morphism of sites associated to the continuous functor $u : \mathcal{C} \to \mathcal{D}$. If $u$ is almost cocontinuous then $f_*$ commutes with pushouts and coequalizers (and more generally finite connected colimits). </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      This is a special case of Lemma <a href="/tag/04B9" data-tag="04B9">7.42.5</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>